Package: Epoch
Title: IEEG (Intracranial Electroencephalography) Epoch Data Tools
Version: 1.0.7
Authors@R: person("Jiefei", "Wang", , "szwjf08@gmail.com", role =
        c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides tools for working with iEEG matrix data,
        including downloading curated iEEG data from OSF (The Open
        Science Framework <https://osf.io/>) (EpochDownloader()),
        making new objects (Epoch()), processing (crop() and
        resample()), and visualizing the data (plot()).
